# `bin` rounds down to a multiple of the size: datetimes from the Unix epoch, negative numbers
# toward negative infinity. A size that is not positive gives null.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project dt = bin(datetime(2024-02-29T23:59:59Z), 1h), wk = bin(datetime(2024-02-29), 7d), ts = bin(95m, 1h), l = bin(17, 5), neg = bin(-7, 5), r = bin(1.75, 0.5), rneg = bin(-0.1, 1.0), zero = bin(5, 0)
---- expected
dt                   | wk                   | ts       | l    | neg  | r    | rneg | zero
datetime             | datetime             | timespan | long | long | real | real | long
---------------------+----------------------+----------+------+------+------+------+-----
2024-02-29T23:00:00Z | 2024-02-29T00:00:00Z | 01:00:00 |   15 |  -10 |  1.5 | -1.0 | null
